  "ingredients": [
    "2 (8 ounce) packages semisweet baking chocolate",
    "16 ounces cream-filled chocolate sandwich cookies (such as Oreo®), divided",
    "1 (8 ounce) package cream cheese, softened"
  ],
  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "Gather all ingredients.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/VGRM8VVIQeW_EfWJDb9IAh_GqWU=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/127491-easy-oreo-truffles-step-01-7c33d3b1ad9b46c1900ba22ff8c1347d.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/127491/step_01.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Melt chocolate in a saucepan over low heat, stirring occasionally, 4 to 6 minutes.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/T7l9glnQ08gxfX_hY2QLLZE_EYA=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/127491-easy-oreo-truffles-step-02-0697ba308eee44bfa4ed8f40add5f5bf.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/127491/step_02.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "While the chocolate is melting, place 9 cream-filled sandwich cookies in a food processor and blend until finely crushed. Transfer crumbs to a bowl and reserve for decorating.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/K1hDfXucMDzRdIPKW_9caJST6qw=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/127491-easy-oreo-truffles-step-03-53b6776394134903a2822f00a3240479.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/127491/step_03.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Add remaining cookies to the food processor and blend until finely crushed. Transfer crumbs to a large bowl and stir in cream cheese; mix until well-blended. Roll mixture into 42 balls, about 1-inch in diameter.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/rv8UYGfQyr9li76IcvO0ACY9A7U=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/127491-easy-oreo-truffles-step-04-071476a52fd04c098dbde7c3824a1ad7.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/127491/step_04.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Place each ball in melted chocolate and use two forks to roll it until fully coated. Lift the ball with both forks and allow excess chocolate to drip off.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/9TX9Ebxul6AT6sUUw8r9vB0vca4=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/127491-easy-oreo-truffles-step-06-6f72b3bcde194e0daa212396b42fcd7e.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/127491/step_05.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Place coated truffle on a wax paper-lined baking sheet and sprinkle with reserved cookie crumbs to decorate. Repeat to make remaining truffles.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/yE18TX4S9cQAp7xl585asfkDmrY=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/127491-easy-oreo-truffles-step-08-c702f952b20a4d3ea242ae6d5bd0ab5a.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/127491/step_06.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Refrigerate truffles until firm, at least 1 hour. Keep in the refrigerator until just before serving. Enjoy!",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/WFsHlwr7PT85RDeJ2B9edVakHfI=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/127491-easy-oreo-truffles-Beauty-3x4-8a73add44d39451d98c98e264ac35b9b.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/127491/step_07.webp"
    }
  ],
